{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Chapter 4: The Attack That Changed Everything",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s05b01",
     "shot": "todo_august2196",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "August 2, 1964."
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b02",
     "shot": "maddox",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The American destroyer USS Maddox was operating in the Gulf of Tonkin when North",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b03",
     "shot": "maddox",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Vietnamese torpedo boats attacked it.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boom",
       "w:attacked",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b04",
     "shot": "maddox",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "This first attack was real.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:real.",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b05",
     "shot": "maddox",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The Maddox exchanged fire with the boats, and American aircraft joined the engagement.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boom",
       6,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "boom",
       26,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:aircraft",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b06",
     "shot": "maddox",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The incident caused no American fatalities, and the destroyer sustained only minor damage.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:fatalities,",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:minor",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b07",
     "shot": "night_reports",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Two days later, another attack was reported.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:another",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves",
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b08",
     "shot": "night_reports",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Or at least, that's what American officials initially believed.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "waves",
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b09",
     "shot": "night_reports",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On August 4, the Maddox and another destroyer reported what appeared to be incoming",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "waves",
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b10",
     "shot": "night_reports",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "North Vietnamese torpedo boats.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "waves",
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b11",
     "shot": "night_reports",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "But the conditions were terrible.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "waves",
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b12",
     "shot": "night_reports",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It was dark.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "deflate",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves",
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b13",
     "shot": "night_reports",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The sea was rough.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       2,
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves",
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b14",
     "shot": "night_reports",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Radar readings were confusing.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "blip",
       4,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "blip",
       20,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "blip",
       36,
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves",
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b15",
     "shot": "night_reports",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Crew members struggled to determine what they were actually seeing.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "waves",
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b16",
     "shot": "night_reports",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "As reports came in, doubts emerged about whether an attack had taken place at all.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:doubts",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves",
     "mood": "tension"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b17",
     "shot": "lbj_office",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Those doubts did not stop the White House.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:stop",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b18",
     "shot": "lbj_office",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "President Lyndon B.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b19",
     "shot": "lbj_office",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Johnson wanted the authority to respond militarily to North Vietnamese actions.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b20",
     "shot": "lbj_office",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "His administration used the reported attacks to push Congress for a resolution giving him",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       6,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b21",
     "shot": "lbj_office",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "broad powers to conduct military operations in Southeast Asia.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b22",
     "shot": "votes",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Congress approved it.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:approved",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b23",
     "shot": "votes",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The House voted 416–0.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:416–0.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b24",
     "shot": "votes",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The Senate voted 88–2.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:88–2.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b25",
     "shot": "votes",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The Gulf of Tonkin Resolution was now law.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:law.",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b26",
     "shot": "votes",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It gave Johnson the authority to take extensive military action without Congress formally declaring war.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:without",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b27",
     "shot": "never",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But here's the extraordinary part.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b28",
     "shot": "never",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The second attack almost certainly never happened.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "blip",
       4,
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:never",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b29",
     "shot": "never",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Later reviews of intelligence records, including a major National Security Agency historical study declassified",
     "date": 2005,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:National",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b30",
     "shot": "never",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "decades afterward, showed that the August 4 reports had been badly misinterpreted.",
     "date": 2005,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b31",
     "shot": "never",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The evidence did not support the claim that North Vietnamese forces had launched a",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b32",
     "shot": "never",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "second attack that night.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b33",
     "shot": "never",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The first attack was real.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b34",
     "shot": "never",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The second was not.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "hit",
       "w:not.",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b35",
     "shot": "escalate",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Yet the second incident helped provide the political justification for a massive escalation of American involvement.",
     "date": 1964,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b36",
     "shot": "escalate",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And within months, the United States was no longer simply advising another country's military.",
     "date": 1965,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b37",
     "shot": "escalate",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It was sending its own soldiers into combat.",
     "date": 1965,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "steps",
       2,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b38",
     "shot": "escalate",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "America was about to enter a war that would consume more than a decade",
     "date": 1965,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b39",
     "shot": "escalate",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "of American combat operations, and nearly two decades of growing involvement.",
     "date": 1965,
     "sfx": []
    }
   ],
   "mood": "tension"
  }
 ]
}